#: ui/app.slint:1329
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Change the unlock protection?"
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1330
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid ""
"The vault's password lock is written again with {}. Your items stay as they "
"are; every device that opens the vault then needs that much memory and time "
"per unlock. Windows Hello turns off until you turn it on again."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1331
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Apply"
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1355
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Make a keyfile?"
