msgstr ""

#: ui/pages.slint:2584
msgctxt "SettingsPage"
msgid ""
"Keeps this vault the same on your other devices: through a folder they all "
"see (OneDrive, Google Drive, Dropbox, Syncthing, a network share), your own "
"vault server, or a WebDAV folder (Nextcloud, a NAS). A phone needs the "
"server or WebDAV."
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages.slint:2585
msgctxt "SettingsPage"
msgid ""
"Each device writes only its own copy, encrypted like the vault file: it "
"opens only with your master password and Secret Key, which never leave your "
"devices. With a folder this app sends nothing anywhere; the folder's own "
"program carries the files. A server gets only these sealed copies and each "
"device's public key, and every request is signed by the device. Copies are "
"merged item by item: an item deleted on one device is deleted on all, and "
"when the same item was changed on two, the newer version is kept and the "
"other password goes into its history. An older copy put back is refused."
msgstr ""

